  "title": "Numbers and age",
  "note": "Learn 0 to 20 by heart. From 21 the tens join the units, and the tens drop their final vowel before uno and otto: ventuno, ventotto. Age uses avere (to have): Ho vent'anni, \"I'm twenty.\"",
